[[File:MTTopenforbusiness-SWE.png|thumb|300px|[[B1-series battle droid]]s are carried by a Multi-Troop Transport]]
A '''troop transport''', also known as a '''troopship''', was a vehicle that [[Transport|ferried]] [[trooper]]s.

==History==
===Clone Wars===
[[File:Battle_droids_EGTW.jpg|thumb|right|250px|B1 battle droids march alongside an MTT, which deploys more B1s.]]
Various models of troop transports were used throughout the [[Clone Wars]]. The [[Galactic Republic]] [[transport]]ed [[trooper]]s with their [[Low Altitude Assault Transport/infantry|LAAT/i gunships]]<ref name="USW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> and [[Nu-class attack/transport shuttle|''Nu''-class attack/transport shuttle]].<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> The [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] likewise employed troop transports, including the [[Multi-Troop Transport]] and the [[C-9979 landing craft]].<ref name="USW" />

===Galactic Civil War===
Troop transports used by the [[Galactic Empire]] included the [[Lambda-class T-4a shuttle|''Lambda''-class T-4a shuttle]], [[K79-S80 Imperial Troop Transport|Imperial Troop Transport]], and [[Sentinel-class landing craft|''Sentinel''-class landing craft]]. The [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] used [[UT-60D U-wing starfighter/support craft]] to transport rebel troops into battle.<ref name="USW" />

===New Republic Era===
[[File:ResistanceTransport-TFAVD.png||thumb|left|250px|A Resistance transport with its front troop door open]]
The [[First Order]] made widespread use of the [[AAL-1971/9.1 Troop Transport]] to ferry its stormtroopers from orbital ships to other ships, stations and planetary surfaces in their subjugation of the [[Unknown Regions]] and throughout their campaign against the [[New Republic]] during and after the Cold War.<ref name="TFAVD">''[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref>

The [[Resistance]] made use of the [[Resistance transport]]<ref name="RTR">{{Resistance|Rebuilding the Resistance}}</ref> and the [[YC-123B transport hauler]]<ref name="ROSVD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> for troop transport during various operations during the same period.<ref name="RTR" /><ref name="ROSVD" />

